{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"dengzhang-e-o136","title":"张纲上书劾梁冀","accounts":[{"id":"dengzhang-a-c5e7f40d8fee94c6d2c5","label":"裴注·续汉书","text":"张纲上书劾梁冀","evidence":["dengzhang-q-4c854a560c6353dcbb8e"]}],"participants":[{"person":"dengzhang-p0021","role":"独埋车轮于洛阳都亭不去，曰豺狼当路安问狐狸，上书条奏大将军梁冀、河南尹不疑无君之心十五事","evidence":["dengzhang-q-4c854a560c6353dcbb8e"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0002","role":"大将军，侵扰百姓，为张纲所劾","evidence":["dengzhang-q-4c854a560c6353dcbb8e"]},{"person":"dengzhang-p0040","role":"河南尹，为张纲所劾","evidence":["dengzhang-q-4c854a560c6353dcbb8e"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["dengzhang-q-4c854a560c6353dcbb8e"]},"ordering_evidence":"dengzhang-q-4c854a560c6353dcbb8e","source_order":[45,71,139],"order":7890}],"persons":[{"id":"dengzhang-p0021","name":"张纲","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"dengzhang-p0040","name":"梁不疑","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0002","name":"梁冀","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"dengzhang-q-4c854a560c6353dcbb8e","section":"chapter-045","block":"b-8204d62ca48619f1ab78","layer":"pei","quote":"唯纲独埋车轮于洛阳都亭，不去，曰：‘豺狼当路，安问狐狸！’遂上书曰：‘大将军梁冀、河南尹不疑：蒙外戚之援，荷国厚恩；以刍荛之姿，安居阿保；不能敷扬五教，翼赞日月；而专为封豕长蛇，肆其贪饕；甘心好货，纵恣无厌；多树诌谀，以害忠良：诚天威所不赦，大辟所宜加也！谨条其无君之心十五事于左，皆忠臣之所切齿也。’书奏御，京师震悚","attribution":"裴注·续汉书","section_title":"邓张宗杨传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0096.xhtml","index":70,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c5879cbe3d59542c346b","start":139,"end":298,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
